==== NeckProtectionModifier ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Parameter for clothes. Specifies a modifier that affects the chance of a successful wound to the neck. Max value: 1.0
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
NeckProtectionModifier = 0.5,
